          "id": "physics3d",
          "summary": "Opt-in fixed-step Rapier 3D rigid bodies, sphere/box/capsule/convex/static triangle mesh, sensors, collision groups, CCD, sleeping, ray/shape queries and sorted contact lifecycle. Lua owns commands and gameplay reactions. Legacy moving-sphere sweep remains available.",
          "status": "available",
